AI session integration tests model independent machines with fake agents, but
their liveness checks still see the build host's processes. On macOS, another
user's unreadable Node process can therefore make an idle Pi fixture look live.

Give each test machine its own proc fixture. The override is compiled only with
the existing test-utils feature; the installed binary keeps real process checks.

